            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:1.5em;\"><strong>INFORMATION TEXT (Part 2)</strong></span></p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "55aaf4d3-f7e3-4a3e-9196-01a6f7474f94"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Course of the War</strong><br>\nIn the early stages of the war, the Arab states achieved significant successes. They crossed the Suez Canal and recaptured the Golan Heights. However, Israel was able to stabilize its lines and eventually began to push back the Arab forces. The fighting continued until October 25, 1973.</p>\n\n<p><strong>International Reactions</strong><br>\nThe international community responded with concern to the war. The United States supported Israel, while the Soviet Union supported the Arab states. This conflict put the two superpowers in a delicate situation and heightened tensions during the Cold War.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Ceasefire and Peace Negotiations</strong><br>\nOn October 25, a ceasefire was reached, putting an end to the fighting. After the war, peace negotiations began between Israel and the Arab states. These negotiations eventually led to a peace agreement between Israel and Egypt in 1979.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "3b13867b-feab-4e2e-bfa2-fcc82e4dbff1"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
